       inputs, which a user can't independently know without already having
       solved the bias question. Added a Vehicle Dynamics mode that computes
       the ideal dynamic bias from weight, wheelbase, CG height, static weight
       distribution and target deceleration (accounting for weight transfer
       under braking) — this is the actual engineering answer to "what brake
       bias should my car have." The original Measured Force mode is kept for
       checking the bias of an already-built proportioning setup. */
    const mode_bb = GHM_STORAGE.get('bb_mode')||'dynamic';
